  <entry>
    <id>http://arxiv.org/abs/2610.00002v1</id>
    <title>Graph Neural Networks for Molecule Property Prediction</title>
    <updated>2026-09-29T10:00:00Z</updated>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.00002v1" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <summary>We present a message passing graph neural network for predicting molecular properties. The
      model uses equivariant layers and attention over atom neighbourhoods. On standard quantum
      chemistry benchmarks it reduces mean absolute error compared with prior graph networks, while
      training twice as fast on a single GPU.</summary>
    <category term="cs.LG" scheme="http://arxiv.org/schemas/atom"/>
    <published>2026-09-29T10:00:00Z</published>
